OL,3,GNEWSAReport recommends #1 per night
OL,4,Atourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report has recommended imposing a
OL,7,F#1 per night tourist tax across York
OL,8,Fand North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FCommissioned by the mayor of York and
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire, David Skaith, the
OL,12,FPolicy Lab review said the levy could
OL,13,Fraise #26m for the region each year,
OL,14,Fwhich could be ring-fenced for
OL,15,Ftourism-related purposes.
OL,17,FAccording to the report, potential
OL,18,Fexemptions could be made for low-cost
OL,19,Fstays in a bid to reduce the burden on
OL,20,Fsmall operators and campsites.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
